  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.41 with immutable ProGPU preview.47; consumes compact retained picture commands, glyph/scalar/layer records, specialized single-run text blobs, and nonblocking reusable image readback without a bridge workaround; retains the typed, zero-allocation media drawing-state seam, native activation, popup-local input diagnostics, bounded render-resource ownership, and static-frame render suppression; and preserves the Windows OLE clipboard and cross-platform input, popup, theme, WPFGallery, and designer gates.",
